#: src/features/analytics/Install.tsx
msgid "Add the YuvaAnalytics library of the Yuva package and configure it once at launch. .yuvaScreen counts a SwiftUI screen; in UIKit, call YuvaAnalytics.screen when a screen appears. Without a connection, events wait on the device for up to 72 hours and arrive with their own times."
msgstr "Afegeix la biblioteca YuvaAnalytics del paquet de Yuva i configura-la una vegada a l'inici. .yuvaScreen compta una pantalla SwiftUI; a UIKit, crida YuvaAnalytics.screen quan apareix una pantalla. Sense connexió, els esdeveniments esperen al dispositiu fins a 72 hores i arriben amb les seves pròpies hores."

#: src/features/analytics/Install.tsx
msgid "Add yuva-analytics from JitPack and configure it once in Application.onCreate. TrackScreen counts a Compose screen. Without a connection, events wait on the device for up to 72 hours and arrive with their own times."
msgstr "Afegeix yuva-analytics des de JitPack i configura'l una vegada a Application.onCreate. TrackScreen compta una pantalla Compose. Sense connexió, els esdeveniments esperen al dispositiu fins a 72 hores i arriben amb les seves pròpies hores."

