#: src/features/analytics/Install.tsx
msgid "Content blockers often stop scripts from other domains. Serving the script and its endpoint from your own site keeps those visitors counted. The Yuva server has to trust your proxy’s forwarded address; otherwise all visitors look like one."
msgstr "Els bloquejadors de contingut sovint aturen els scripts d'altres dominis. Servir l'script i el seu endpoint des del teu propi lloc manté comptats aquests visitants. El servidor de Yuva ha de confiar en l'adreça reenviada del teu proxy; si no, tots els visitants semblen un de sol."

